# FIXED DEFECT 427's shape beside it, lane b13-w411, 2026-10-07.
#
# A `cstr` lent to a pointer the pointee check reads now crosses cast to the
# header's own type, so the probe's call no longer refuses one that points at
# no kind of byte, as it did as `ffi_parameter_type`. The check asks it
# instead (`emit/ffi_read_only.hero`, the bytes question), on the same line as
# its `const` question, and tells it on the parameter.
#
# THIS SHAPE: a pointer to a `const` struct.

extern "fixedbugs-427-no-byte.h"
    function r_pair(p: cstr lent) -> i32  #~ ffi_parameter_type

function main()
    print(r_pair(p: "abcdefgh".cstr()))
